# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M6 isotopes (Dock > Selection): select H2's nucleus 0 and make it 2H. The mass changes, the
# surface does not (SetIsotope changes the mass only and books the kinetic energy); the run then
# plays on it. The pause lands a machine-dependent number of steps after the 8 waited for; the
# script checks only what does not depend on it.
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
# pinned at the merge of main (2026-10-14): written for the presets' own 49^3 x 0.25 grid (Balanced)
# without container walls, before the app defaulted to Accurate (81^3) with walls on; H2 is the
# R = 1.6 Bohr scene it was written for (h2_r16.scene; the h2 preset is 1.45 Bohr now)
action ionic none
action quality balanced
action walls off 4.5
scene h2_r16.scene
wait idle
action tool select
t 100 cursor 0.1043005 0.0244677
t 110 button left down
t 170 button left up
expect selected 0
action isotope 0 2
wait idle
expect isotope 0 2
expect isotope 1 1
action play
wait steps 8
action pause
wait idle
expect isotope 0 2
expect paused true
expect no-error
